19:39.000 --> 19:39.830
Mak!

19:39.830 --> 19:40.790
Cepat lari!

19:41.030 --> 19:42.590
Mak!

19:43.270 --> 19:43.750
Cepat!

19:48.110 --> 19:49.240
Sini, sebelah sini!

19:56.720 --> 19:57.640
